Our collaborative work titled **“Effect of Nozzle Geometry on the Combustion Characteristics of Ammonia/Oxygen in a Constant-Volume Combustion Chamber with a Pre-Chamber Configuration”** has been accepted for publication in *International Journal of Hydrogen Energy*.

The study examines the effect of size and confriguation of the nozzle geometry on neat ammonia combustion under Constant-Volume Combustion Chamber setup.

